AB  - The proceedings contain 36 papers. The topics discussed include: expanding IoT connectivity by using 2.4 GHz lora technology; trends in the detection and interpretation of human movements and mime-gesture; ai driven adaptive security mesh: cloud container protection for dynamic threat landscapes; exploring gender bias and toxic comments using artificial intelligence: trends and implications; revolutionizing upper limb motor control restoration: a novel EMG-based feedback system for individuals with neurological diseases; infrared image recognition of power equipment based on improved yolov5; advancing towards clinical validation of an innovative system for restoring upper limb control in individuals with neurological disorders; and monitoring energy losses of a residential building through thermographic assessments.
